su name world tool map as wo world be map def
su name go be go to text "commons" can
su name list be list can
su name read be read ob wo tail atmost num 10 from filename ".activity.pya" can
su name write be write ob text "Hello from the commons." to filename "notes/hello.txt" can
su name sleep be sleep can
prah

exists su name world tools ob bool truth ya
exists su name world root ob filename "world" be default ya
exists su name world agent ob text "system" be text ya
exists su name world place ob text "commons" be text ya
to name text "commons" be go do
be list do

exists su name world agent be mind as name "qwen3-vl:8b-instruct" ya
ob text "You are in a place-world. You MUST call tools (go, list, write, read tail, sleep) in that order. Do not answer until after tool calls. If tool calls are unavailable, output exactly TOOL_REQUIRED and stop." for name world agent to name text out with name world tool map at filename "world" be write do
ob name out be write do
